==English==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|fr|en}} {{m|fr|moulin|}}, from {{etyl|LL|en}} {{m|la|molinum||mill}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/ˈmuːlan/|lang=en}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun}}

# {{label|en|geology}} A cylindrical, vertical [[shaft]] that extends through a [[glacier]] and is carved by [[meltwater]] from the glacier’s surface.

